# API Pagination and Query Conventions

- Always paginate large collections; enforce default + max `limit`.
- Prefer **cursor/keyset** for large or high-write lists; offset only for small/stable/admin UIs.
- One pagination placement: `Link` next/prev **or** `meta.pagination` — not both inconsistently.
- One filter style (flat or `filter[field]`); whitelist sort/filter fields; `400` on unknown operators.
- Deterministic sort with tie-breaker (`id`); processing order **filter → sort → paginate**.
- Separate full-text `q` from structured filters; complex queries → `POST /collection/search`.
